From d4cf70facc1e632d36fc71df07ccacaab43daf16 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:21:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add PHP Monster abduction finale with "to be continued"
 ending

After Ela is rescued in the last level, a scripted cutscene plays: the
PHP Monster's UFO descends, beams Ela (or Musa in swapped-roles mode)
aboard and flies off, with dialogue bubbles between the hero, the
captive and the monster. Jump skips to the next line. The final screen
now announces new levels next Friday. Strings translated for en, de,
ar and zh.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Y9EH1irctHFQevk4c55yxo
